"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The tracker’s worker checks each event’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"constraintViolation()"},{"text":" before anything else, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rejected event is never enriched, held by a consent, written to a store or delivered. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"record a store recovered is checked too, and one rejected is forgotten by the store. In","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"debug builds each rejection is also logged at error level.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a rejection joins the waiting report of the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event, property and keyword, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reports waiting unread are at most one per constraint the app declares, however many events"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"break them. Copies of a tracker share one sequence, which has one consumer and ends once the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker has finished. A "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp"},{"type":"text","text":" tracker’s is empty."}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/rejectionreports"]}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/records-swift.property":{"title":"records","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The records of the events this tracker tracks, for a delivery to read.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/records-swift.property","fragments":[{"text"